@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@* Lab adaptation (Sprint 33.9, FE33-039): the BeeDay source injects AuthenticatedUserInitializer
   (a real backend service that hydrates the signed-in user from BeeDay.Application/Infrastructure
   on every authenticated page load) and calls EnsureInitializedAsync() in OnInitializedAsync. The
   Lab has no real user/auth backend to initialize against (ADR-008 forbids real authentication
   infrastructure), so both the injection and the override are dropped entirely. Everything else —
   the beeday-app/beeday-workspace structure, SkipToContentLink, MobileHeader, DesktopNavigation,
   MobileSidebar, BeeDayErrorBoundary, BeeDayToastHost, and the mobile-nav-open toggle state — is
   presentation-only and copied/adapted as-is.

   Sprint 35.1-R3 (OWNER direction change): DesktopSidebar is replaced by DesktopNavigation, a
   persistent horizontal top bar (see that component's own remarks) instead of a persistent left
   column — so the previous .beeday-shell wrapper, which existed only to lay the sidebar and
   .beeday-workspace out side by side, no longer has a second element to arrange and is removed;
   .beeday-workspace is now a direct child of .beeday-app. MobileHeader/MobileSidebar are unchanged —
   only one of MobileHeader/DesktopNavigation is ever visible at a time (each toggles via its own
   1200px CSS breakpoint, exactly as MobileHeader/DesktopSidebar did before). *@
<div class="beeday-app">
    <SkipToContentLink />
    <MobileHeader IsNavOpen="@_isMobileNavOpen" OnToggleNav="ToggleMobileNav" />
    <DesktopNavigation />

    <div class="beeday-workspace">
        <main id="main-content" class="beeday-main beeday-main--authenticated">
            <BeeDayErrorBoundary>@Body</BeeDayErrorBoundary>
        </main>
    </div>

    <MobileSidebar IsOpen="@_isMobileNavOpen"
                   OnClose="CloseMobileNav" />

    <BeeDayToastHost />
</div>

@code {
    private bool _isMobileNavOpen;
    private void ToggleMobileNav() => _isMobileNavOpen = !_isMobileNavOpen;

    private void CloseMobileNav() => _isMobileNavOpen = false;
}
